kind: stack
title: Frame of a QB procedure (far call, Pascal order)
arrow "higher addresses" up
cell "parameters" note="Pascal: first formal furthest from [bp+6]"
cell "return address" note="far" fill=a
cell "runtime header" note="BP at its top; 10 bytes QB 4.5 / llrm, 18 bytes PDS 7.1, 20 bytes VBDOS; holds saved BP, frame chain, SI, DI" fill=b
cell "source locals and spills" note="SP at the bottom"
arrow "stack grows down" down
